# Security - Entire projects directory (contains generated keys, licenses, and project-specific configs)
# NEVER commit this directory - it contains:
# - RSA private/public keys (private_key.rsa, public_key.rsa)
# - Generated license files (.lic)
# - Project-specific configuration headers (licensecc_properties.h, public_key.h)
# - License encryption keys (license_encryption.key)
projects/

# Security - Additional protection for keys anywhere in the tree
license_encryption.key
*.key
**/license_encryption.key
**/*_key.rsa
**/*.lic
